  "name": "Leah",
  "title": "Matriarch of six tribes",
  "era": "patriarchs",
  "lifespan": "c. 1800–1740 BC",
  "summary": "Leah was Jacob's first wife and Rachel's older sister. Although Jacob did not love her as much as Rachel, God blessed her with six sons and a daughter. Through Judah came the royal line and the Messiah, and through Levi came the priestly line.",
